{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934420/extras/fed2aae1bd4824b7dbbf5d33cb9fc585.avif?t=1757013271\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><strong></strong><br><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934420/extras/8f1bb9594825699c690f65686760804c.poster.avif?t=1757013271\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934420/extras/8f1bb9594825699c690f65686760804c.webm?t=1757013271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>\ud83e\udded A journey of grief, memory... and the sea.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Jack</strong>, a widowed old man who sets sail across an island, chasing the remnants of his past and the echoes of his lost wife, the love of his life, Marleen. As the tides shift, so too do the borders between reality and memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Explore, fight, and reflect.</strong><br>Uncover secrets hidden in forgotten caves and locations. Face off against towering colossi in dynamic combat. Ride your horse, solve environmental puzzles, and sail freely between the main island and neighboring islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0a A poetic Zelda-like adventure.</strong><br>Blending stylized exploration with emotional storytelling, <i>The Man Who Fought the Heavens</i> invites players into a world where loss is both a weapon and a compass.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd36 KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Open  exploration</strong> via boat and horseback, swimming &amp; climbing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Stylized action combat</strong> inspired by Zelda and Shadow of the Colossus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Narrative-driven gameplay</strong> focused on grief, memory, and self-discovery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Environmental puzzles and secrets</strong> in a handcrafted world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic weather and day/night system</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Atmospheric soundscape</strong> that responds to gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Beautiful stylized visuals</strong>\u00a0of the island and sea<br>  <br>  </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3934420?t=1757013271","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934420/53cd7b27237b9e37901b2da6053d81d71b68ec92/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757013271","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934420/9894806976d7d00d7e5076293ebb097062ca462a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757013271","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934420/9894806976d7d00d7e5076293ebb097062ca462a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757013271","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934420/extras/fed2aae1bd4824b7dbbf5d33cb9fc585.avif?t=1757013271\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><strong></strong><br><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://s